    https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_4937,h_2777/c_fill,w_2160,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FReutersImages%2Fmmsport%2Fbucks_zone%2F01ky0qjx6r6bxcjwc898.jpg 3x" media="(min-width: 1080px)"><img src="https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_4937,h_2777/c_fill,w_720,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images/ReutersImages/mmsport/bucks_zone/01ky0qjx6r6bxcjwc898.jpg" alt="Jul 20, 2021; Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA;  Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) celebrates after game six of the 2021 NBA Finals against the Phoenix Suns at Fiserv Forum. Mandatory Credit: Mark J. Rebilas-USA TODAY Sports" title="Jul 20, 2021; Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA;  Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) celebrates after game six of the 2021 NBA Finals against the Phoenix Suns at Fiserv Forum. Mandatory Credit: Mark J. Rebilas-USA TODAY Sports" width="360" height="203" class="undefined w-full w-full" q:id="8v"></picture></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><div data-lead-image="true" class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-4 text-grey font-group-tiny"><figcaption q:id="8w">Jul 20, 2021; Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA;  Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) celebrates after game six of the 2021 NBA Finals against the Phoenix Suns at Fiserv Forum. Mandatory Credit: Mark J. Rebilas-USA TODAY Sports | USA TODAY Sports</figcaption></div></figure><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=8x q:key=AxY3:1--><!--qv q:id=8y q:key=NBvp:jq_3--><!--qv q:key=8X_3--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=8z q:key=AxY3:6--><!--qv q:id=90 q:key=Y0xy:jq_3--><div class="mt-8 md:mt-0" q:key="wq_2"><div class="mb-8" q:key="wq_1"><p class="font-group-tiny mb-4">In this story:</p><!--qv q:id=91 q:key=Qyyc:wq_0--><div class="relative" q:key="6a_2"><!--qv q:id=92 q:key=a6Je:6a_0--><!--qv q:key=7Z_4--><!--/qv--><script type="placeholder" hidden q:id="93" on-document:qinit="q-DyEiX4lM.js#_hW[0]"></script><!--/qv--><div class="flex gap-2 scroll-smooth no-scrollbar overflow-x-hidden" q:id="94"><!--qv q:s q:sref=91 q:key=--><!--qv q:id=95 q:key=BgPR:si-milwaukee-bucks-nba--><a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks" data-testtype="tag" class="block p-2.5 border border-solid min-w-min w-max whitespace-nowrap font-group-tiny bg-white text-darkGrey hover:text-secondary border-darkGrey hover:border-secondary" q:key="12_0" q:id="96"><!--t=97-->Milwaukee Bucks<!----></a><!--/qv--><!--/qv--></div></div><!--/qv--></div></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--></header><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=98 q:key=AxY3:1--><!--qv q:id=99 q:key=j0EP:jq_3--><!--qv q:key=RU_1--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=9a q:key=AxY3:2--><!--qv q:id=9b q:key=f8mi:jq_2--><div class="min-w-0 flex-1" q:key="XW_1"><div class="viewablity-block"><!--qv q:s q:sref=9b q:key=--><!--qv q:id=9c q:key=grEV:jq_1--><!--qv q:id=9d q:key=AxY3:0--><!--qv q:id=9e q:key=hjK3:jq_3--><!--qv q:key=pd_1--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=9f q:key=AxY3:1--><!--qv q:id=9g q:key=VnLw:jq_3--><figure class="player-wrapper relative aspect-video mb-[18px] bg-grey rounded-md player-wrapper-lg" on-document:qinit="q-CmJSTBVU.js#_hW[0]" q:key="7D_5" q:id="9h"><div id="mmvid" class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full" q:id="9i"></div></figure><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=9j q:key=AxY3:2--><!--qv q:id=9k q:key=k1xw:jq_3--><div class="article-content" q:key="QW_9"><!--qv q:id=9l q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_0" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_0" data-vo-slot-index="0" data-vo-article-index="0" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="9m"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=9n q:key=v0hb:QW_2--><!--qv q:key=ft_2--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=9o q:key=vcaa:<p>With 25.5 seconds remaining, head coach Mike Budenholzer calls a timeout as forward Khris Middleton holds on to the ball.</p>--><!--qv q:id=9p q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-0" class="mt-[18px] md:mt-0 mb-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="9q">With 25.5 seconds remaining, head coach Mike Budenholzer calls a timeout as forward Khris Middleton holds on to the ball.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=9r q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_1" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_1" data-vo-slot-index="1" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="9s"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=9t q:key=vcaa:<p>The Milwaukee bucks leads 104-96, and the entire Fiserv Forum is shaking with excitement as everyone in the arena knows they are a few seconds away from cementing themselves in NBA history. </p>--><!--qv q:id=9u q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-1" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="9v">The Milwaukee bucks leads 104-96, and the entire Fiserv Forum is shaking with excitement as everyone in the arena knows they are a few seconds away from cementing themselves in NBA history. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=9w q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_2" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_2" data-vo-slot-index="2" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="9x"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=9y q:key=vcaa:<p>The clock expires and on July 20, 2021, after 50 long years, the Bucks are NBA champions defeating the Phoenix Suns, 105-98 in six games to win their second championship in franchise history.</p>--><!--qv q:id=9z q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-2" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="a0">The clock expires and on July 20, 2021, after 50 long years, the Bucks are NBA champions defeating the Phoenix Suns, 105-98 in six games to win their second championship in franchise history.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=a1 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_3" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_3" data-vo-slot-index="3" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="a2"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=a3 q:key=vcaa:https://x.com/Bucks/status/2079204932469788983--><!--qv q:id=a4 q:key=YFn6:mL_1--><figure on:qvisible="q-BuvmRp0E.js#_hW[0]" q:key="HU_0" q:id="a5"><blockquote class="twitter-tweet"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">Five years ago today, we won it all. <a href="https://t.co/tspuL5iKTn">pic.twitter.com/tspuL5iKTn</a></p>— Milwaukee Bucks (@Bucks) <a href="https://x.com/Bucks/status/2079204932469788983?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">July 20, 2026</a></blockquote></figure><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=a6 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_4" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_4" data-vo-slot-index="4" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="twitter" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="a7"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=a8 q:key=vcaa:<p>Behind 50 points, 14 rebounds and five blocks,<a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks/onsi/the-rise-and-fall-of-giannis-antetokounmpo-s-time-with-the-milwaukee-bucks-01kvb6f57pcv"> Giannis Antetokounmpo</a> dominated his way to an NBA Championship and a Finals MVP. He raises his trophy up high and in that moment he&#39;s the most loved person in Milwaukee.</p>--><!--qv q:id=a9 q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-4" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="aa">Behind 50 points, 14 rebounds and five blocks,<a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks/onsi/the-rise-and-fall-of-giannis-antetokounmpo-s-time-with-the-milwaukee-bucks-01kvb6f57pcv"> Giannis Antetokounmpo</a> dominated his way to an NBA Championship and a Finals MVP. He raises his trophy up high and in that moment he&#39;s the most loved person in Milwaukee.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=ab q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_5" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_5" data-vo-slot-index="5" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="ac"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=ad q:key=vcaa:<p>Fast forward five years in the future, and the same man who helped them to a championship is wearing an entirely different jersey. </p>--><!--qv q:id=ae q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-5" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="af">Fast forward five years in the future, and the same man who helped them to a championship is wearing an entirely different jersey. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=ag q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_6" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_6" data-vo-slot-index="6" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="ah"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=ai q:key=vcaa:<p>If I told Milwaukee fans back then that Antetokounmpo would be traded to another team, everyone would think I was delusional. But as now in 2026, that&#39;s the reality.</p>--><!--qv q:id=aj q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-6" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="ak">If I told Milwaukee fans back then that Antetokounmpo would be traded to another team, everyone would think I was delusional. But as now in 2026, that&#39;s the reality.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=al q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_7" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_7" data-vo-slot-index="7" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="am"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=an q:key=vcaa:<p>The Bucks traded their last two remaining pieces from that championship team this offseason in Antetokounmpo and fan favorite<a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks/onsi/milwaukee-bucks-say-goodbye-to-giannis-antetokounmpo-and-bobby-portis-01kww5nna603"> Bobby Portis</a>, to the Miami Heat to put the final nail in the coffin of Antetokounmpo era. </p>--><!--qv q:id=ao q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-7" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="ap">The Bucks traded their last two remaining pieces from that championship team this offseason in Antetokounmpo and fan favorite<a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks/onsi/milwaukee-bucks-say-goodbye-to-giannis-antetokounmpo-and-bobby-portis-01kww5nna603"> Bobby Portis</a>, to the Miami Heat to put the final nail in the coffin of Antetokounmpo era. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=aq q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_8" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_8" data-vo-slot-index="8" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="ar"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=as q:key=vcaa:<p>Just five years ago, Milwaukee were the champions of the NBA and stood at the top, but now every player from that team is gone.</p>--><!--qv q:id=at q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-8" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="au">Just five years ago, Milwaukee were the champions of the NBA and stood at the top, but now every player from that team is gone.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=av q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_9" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_9" data-vo-slot-index="9" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="aw"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=ax q:key=vcaa:<p>The Bucks swept the Heat in the first round, battled and defeated Kevin Durant and the Brooklyn Nets in seven games and then took down the Atlanta Hawks in six games to go to the NBA Finals. </p>--><!--qv q:id=ay q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-9" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="az">The Bucks swept the Heat in the first round, battled and defeated Kevin Durant and the Brooklyn Nets in seven games and then took down the Atlanta Hawks in six games to go to the NBA Finals. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=b0 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_10" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_10" data-vo-slot-index="10" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="b1"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=b2 q:key=vcaa:<p>It wasn&#39;t the best start for Milwaukee in the finals as the Bucks started the series down 0-2, but after a few iconic plays from Antetokounmpo including the block on Deandre Ayton in Game 4 and the &#34;Valley Oop&#34; in Game 5, the Bucks won three straight games to lead the series three games to two. </p>--><!--qv q:id=b3 q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-10" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="b4">It wasn&#39;t the best start for Milwaukee in the finals as the Bucks started the series down 0-2, but after a few iconic plays from Antetokounmpo including the block on Deandre Ayton in Game 4 and the &#34;Valley Oop&#34; in Game 5, the Bucks won three straight games to lead the series three games to two. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=b5 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_11" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_11" data-vo-slot-index="11" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="b6"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=b7 q:key=vcaa:<p>Milwaukee took former Bucks player Brandon Jennings phrase &#34;Bucks in 6&#34; to heart and capped off the series at home to secure the championship. In one of the greatest closeout games in NBA history,  Antetokounmpo took over the game and did everything his in power to come out with a win. </p>--><!--qv q:id=b8 q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-11" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="b9">Milwaukee took former Bucks player Brandon Jennings phrase &#34;Bucks in 6&#34; to heart and capped off the series at home to secure the championship. In one of the greatest closeout games in NBA history,  Antetokounmpo took over the game and did everything his in power to come out with a win. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=ba q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_12" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_12" data-vo-slot-index="12" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="bb"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=bc q:key=vcaa:<p>After years of trying to return to the top as champions, the era finally ended with Milwaukee moving on from Antetokounmpo. The Bucks will go into their first season without one of their greatest players in the franchise history. </p>--><!--qv q:id=bd q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-12" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="be">After years of trying to return to the top as champions, the era finally ended with Milwaukee moving on from Antetokounmpo. The Bucks will go into their first season without one of their greatest players in the franchise history. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=bf q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_13" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_13" data-vo-slot-index="13" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="bg"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=bh q:key=vcaa:https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,w_5641,h_3173,x_0,y_0/images/ReutersImages/mmsport/bucks_zone/01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg--><!--qv q:id=bi q:key=VjqC:mL_1--><!--qv q:id=bj q:key=deAA:7d_3--><!--qv q:s q:sref=bj q:key=--><!--qv q:id=bk q:key=deAA:7d_2--><!--qv q:s q:sref=bk q:key=--><!--qv q:id=bl q:key=cHU9:7d_1--><!--qv q:id=bm q:key=deAA:e2_0--><!--qv q:id=bn q:key=B0c2:SZ_1--><figure q:key="9m_3" q:id="bo"><!--qv q:s q:sref=bn q:key=--><!--qv q:s q:sref=bm q:key=--><div class="overflow-hidden undefined" on:qvisible="q-D-aYne35.js#_hW[0]" on-document:qinit="q-Dj4V4Mje.js#_hW[1]" q:id="bp"><picture style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9"><source srcset="https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_5641,h_3173/c_fill,w_360,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FReutersImages%2Fmmsport%2Fbucks_zone%2F01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg 1x, 
    https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_5641,h_3173/c_fill,w_720,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FReutersImages%2Fmmsport%2Fbucks_zone%2F01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg 2x, 
    https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_5641,h_3173/c_fill,w_1080,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FReutersImages%2Fmmsport%2Fbucks_zone%2F01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg 3x" media="(max-width: 719px)"><source srcset="https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_5641,h_3173/c_fill,w_720,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FReutersImages%2Fmmsport%2Fbucks_zone%2F01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg 1x,
    https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_5641,h_3173/c_fill,w_1440,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FReutersImages%2Fmmsport%2Fbucks_zone%2F01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg 2x, 
    https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_5641,h_3173/c_fill,w_1440,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FReutersImages%2Fmmsport%2Fbucks_zone%2F01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg 3x" media="(max-width: 1079px)"><source srcset="https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_5641,h_3173/c_fill,w_720,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FReutersImages%2Fmmsport%2Fbucks_zone%2F01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg 1x,
    https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_5641,h_3173/c_fill,w_1440,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FReutersImages%2Fmmsport%2Fbucks_zone%2F01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg 2x,
    https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_5641,h_3173/c_fill,w_1440,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FReutersImages%2Fmmsport%2Fbucks_zone%2F01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg 3x" media="(min-width: 1080px)"><img src="https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_5641,h_3173/c_fill,w_16,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images/ReutersImages/mmsport/bucks_zone/01ky198ed734raz9qnsr.jpg" alt="Giannis Antetokounmpo" title="Giannis Antetokounmpo" width="360" height="203" class="undefined w-full w-full blur-[5px]" q:id="bq"></picture></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-grey font-group-tiny m-3"><figcaption q:id="br">Jul 16, 2026; Miami, FL, USA; Miami Heat forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (7) speaks to reporters during his introductory press conference at Kaseya Center. Mandatory Credit: Sam Navarro-Imagn Images | IMAGN IMAGES via Reuters Connect</figcaption></div></figure><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=bs q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_14" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_14" data-vo-slot-index="14" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="image" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="bt"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=bu q:key=vcaa:<p>Milwaukee has gotten younger and officially committed to a rebuild getting <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks/onsi/what-s-in-store-for-the-milwaukee-bucks-as-the-inevitable-giannis-trade-occurs-01kww38m02h8">players</a> such as <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks/onsi/how-tyler-herro-bucks-responded-to-the-altercation-with-bam-adebayo-01kx8s1zh486">Tyler Herro</a>, Jaime Jaquez Jr., <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks/onsi/why-kel-el-ware-feels-like-he-can-flourish-with-the-milwaukee-bucks-01kxbw0ccn9k">Kel&#39;el Ware</a> and Kasparas Jakučionis in return, in addition to future draft capital.</p>--><!--qv q:id=bv q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-14" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="bw">Milwaukee has gotten younger and officially committed to a rebuild getting <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks/onsi/what-s-in-store-for-the-milwaukee-bucks-as-the-inevitable-giannis-trade-occurs-01kww38m02h8">players</a> such as <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks/onsi/how-tyler-herro-bucks-responded-to-the-altercation-with-bam-adebayo-01kx8s1zh486">Tyler Herro</a>, Jaime Jaquez Jr., <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/bucks/onsi/why-kel-el-ware-feels-like-he-can-flourish-with-the-milwaukee-bucks-01kxbw0ccn9k">Kel&#39;el Ware</a> and Kasparas Jakučionis in return, in addition to future draft capital.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=bx q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_15" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_15" data-vo-slot-index="15" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="by"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=bz q:key=vcaa:<p>Some time has passed since the initial trade was announced back in June and though it might hard for some Bucks fans to accept, they will start next season in a position they haven&#39;t experience since 2012 with Antetokounmpo no longer on the roster.</p>--><!--qv q:id=c0 q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-15" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="c1">Some time has passed since the initial trade was announced back in June and though it might hard for some Bucks fans to accept, they will start next season in a position they haven&#39;t experience since 2012 with Antetokounmpo no longer on the roster.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=c2 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_16" data-vo-instance="01ky0q6jk4fp#inline_16" data-vo-slot-index="16" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="c3"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--